</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>OutputType</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>is a model of <ulink url="https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/named_req/CopyAssignable">Assignable</ulink>, and <computeroutput>OutputType</computeroutput> is convertible to <computeroutput>BinaryFunction1&apos;s</computeroutput> first argument type. </para>
